<section class="nc-ingredients nc-reveal" id="ingredients" aria-labelledby="ingredients-title">
  <div class="nc-ingredients__container">
    <div class="nc-badge">Why It Matters</div>
    <h2 class="nc-ingredients__title" id="ingredients-title">The Problem Isn't Willpower. It's Awareness.</h2>
    <p class="nc-ingredients__subtitle">Processed sugar is hidden in 73% of packaged foods. You can't fix what you can't see.</p>
    <div class="nc-ingredients__grid">
      <div class="nc-ingredients__card">
        <div class="nc-ingredients__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128065;</div>
        <h3 class="nc-ingredients__card-title">Hidden in Plain Sight</h3>
        <p class="nc-ingredients__card-desc">Sugar goes by 60+ names on labels — dextrose, maltose, HFCS, "evaporated cane juice." Most people consume it without knowing.</p>
        <span class="nc-ingredients__card-tag">Awareness</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nc-ingredients__card">
        <div class="nc-ingredients__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9888;&#65039;</div>
        <h3 class="nc-ingredients__card-title">Before It Becomes a Problem</h3>
        <p class="nc-ingredients__card-desc">88% of Americans are metabolically unhealthy. The time to act is before pre-diabetes, not after. Prevention starts with what you eat today.</p>
        <span class="nc-ingredients__card-tag">Prevention</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nc-ingredients__card">
        <div class="nc-ingredients__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128200;</div>
        <h3 class="nc-ingredients__card-title">Small Changes, Massive Impact</h3>
        <p class="nc-ingredients__card-desc">Cutting 50g of processed sugar per day reduces your annual intake by 40 pounds. That's the kind of change that reverses trends.</p>
        <span class="nc-ingredients__card-tag">Impact</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nc-ingredients__card">
        <div class="nc-ingredients__card-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#127775;</div>
        <h3 class="nc-ingredients__card-title">A Movement, Not a Fad</h3>
        <p class="nc-ingredients__card-desc">Nightcap exists to help America eliminate processed sugar — through awareness, tools, and better alternatives. The quiz is step one.</p>
        <span class="nc-ingredients__card-tag">Mission</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

